This package is an independent implementation. Its ranking-metric definitions
(precision and recall at k, reciprocal rank, NDCG with gain 2^grade - 1 and a
log2(rank + 1) discount, and the per-query comparison idea) follow the
"Retrieval Evaluation Lab" project in:

  AI Engineering from Scratch
  https://github.com/rohitg00/ai-engineering-from-scratch
  Copyright (c) rohitg00, MIT License

No source code from that project is copied into this package.

